          {
            "title": "Question: Condition",
            "id": 89680,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Liste kavramasındaki koşula göre <code>apply_taxes</code> listesine hangi öğeleri yerleştiriyoruz?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"prices = [\" /><text value=\"150\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"45\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"340\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"apply_taxes = [price \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" price \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" prices \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" price &gt; \" /><text value=\"150\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(apply_taxes)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"[200, 340]\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">150'den büyük olan <code>prices</code> dizisindeki öğeler</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Hiçbir öğeyi filtrelemiyoruz</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">150'den büyük olan <code>prices</code> dizisindeki öğeler.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Koşul her fiyata uygulandıktan sonra program ne yazdırır?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"prices = [\" /><text value=\"150\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"45\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"340\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"apply_taxes = [price \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" price \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" prices \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" price &gt; \" /><text value=\"150\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(apply_taxes)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"[200, 340]\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>[200, 340]</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>[150, 200, 340]</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>[150, 45, 200, 340]</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>[200, 340]</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
