            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bu liste kavrama ifadesi ne yapar?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"item_prices = [\" /><text value=\"120\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"25\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"40\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"under_50 = [price \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" price \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" item_prices \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" price &lt; \" /><text value=\"50\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(under_50)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"[25, 40]\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>item_prices</code> üzerinde döngü oluşturur ve <code>50</code>'den küçük olan her değeri kopyalar</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>item_prices</code> üzerinde döngü kurar ve her değeri kopyalar</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>item_prices</code> üzerinde döngü oluşturur ve <code>50</code>'den küçük olan her değeri kopyalar.</p></body></html>",
