            "title": "Example: Filtering",
            "id": 89683,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>level &lt; 30</code> koşulunu kontrol ederek yalnızca çok düşük seviyeleri almak için <code>humidity</code> listesini filtrele.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"humidity = [\" /><text value=\"40\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"35\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"70\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"too_low = [level \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" level \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" humidity \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" level &lt; \" /><text value=\"30\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(too_low)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"68\" endIndex=\"81\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[20]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>if level &lt; 30</code> ifadesini yazdığından emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
