          {
            "title": "Example: Condition",
            "id": 89686,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Yeni listeye yalnızca Fransızca web sitelerini ekle; bunun için <code>website</code> değişkeninin <code>\".fr\"</code> ifadesini tam olarak bir kez içerip içermediğini kontrol eden bir <code>if</code> ifadesi kodla.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"websites = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;nytimes.com&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;lemonde.fr&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;economist.com&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"french = [website \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" website \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" websites \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" website.count(\" /><text value=\"&quot;.fr&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\") == \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(french)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"101\" endIndex=\"103\" /><option startIndex=\"104\" endIndex=\"124\" /><option startIndex=\"125\" endIndex=\"127\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"['lemonde.fr']\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>if</code>, ardından <code>website.count(\".fr\")</code> ve son olarak <code>==</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Oluşumları saymak için <code>count()</code> kullan. <code>\".fr\"</code> ifadesinin tam olarak bir kez geçtiği web sitelerini tut.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"websites = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;nytimes.com&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;lemonde.fr&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;economist.com&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"french = [website \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" website \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" websites \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" website.count(\" /><text value=\"&quot;.fr&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\") == \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(french)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"101\" endIndex=\"103\" /><option startIndex=\"104\" endIndex=\"124\" /><option startIndex=\"125\" endIndex=\"127\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"website.count(&quot;.com&quot;)\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"['lemonde.fr']\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>if</code>, ardından <code>website.count(\".fr\")</code> ve son olarak <code>==</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
