            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>book_codes</code> içindeki her <code>code</code> değerini yalnızca <code>\"2010\"</code> dizesini içerdiğinde kopyala.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"book_codes = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;FH2010&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;BV1999&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;LB2010&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"books_2010 = [code \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" code \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" book_codes \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" code.count(\" /><text value=\"&quot;2010&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\") == \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(books_2010)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"59\" endIndex=\"63\" /><option startIndex=\"64\" endIndex=\"86\" /><option startIndex=\"87\" endIndex=\"89\" /><option startIndex=\"90\" endIndex=\"108\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"code.count(&quot;1999&quot;)\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"['FH2010', 'LB2010']\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>code</code>, ardından <code>for code in book_codes</code>, <code>if</code> ve son olarak <code>code.count(\"2010\")</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
